sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Patient journey
  accDescr: Sequence: a referring hospital sends a referral. The receiving hospital accepts or declines. If it declines, the referral floats and the family chooses another hospital, or the coordinator records their choice after an alarm. The coordinator sends a free van, a failed ride reopens the barrier. Any hospital the patient reaches confirms arrival and records the outcome, then the 42-day plan starts.
  participant R as Referring hospital
  participant C as Coordinator
  participant H as Receiving hospital
  participant V as Van driver
  participant F as Family

  R->>H: Send referral
  alt Hospital says yes
    H-->>C: Acknowledge and hold a bed
  else Hospital says no
    H-->>F: Referral floats, other hospitals shown
    F->>H: Family chooses, new hospital must reply
    opt No choice in time
      C->>F: Alarm: call the family and record their choice
    end
  end
  F->>F: Sees status, map and directions
  C->>F: Log contact, find barriers
  C->>V: Choose a free van and send it
  V-->>F: Pick up
  alt Ride goes wrong
    V-->>C: Report problem, barrier reopens
    C->>V: Send a van again
  end
  V->>H: Reach a hospital, planned or not
  H->>H: Confirm arrival
  H->>H: Record outcome
  H-->>C: 42-day plan starts
  C->>F: Follow-up visits to day 42
